window.products.push({"id":613007,"name":"Air Fryer, PINSOON Digital Air Fryer Oven 3.7 Quart with LED Touchscreen Non-Stick Fry Basket, Auto-Shutoff Safety System, Recipes Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fB8HJi7KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Deep Frying Has Never Been Healthier Love fried foods but worried about the artery clogging fat? No problem! The PINSOON oilless air fryer lets you enjoy crispy french fries, savory meats, and hearty vegetables with up to 80% less fat. Make Cooking Fast, Easy, and Fun Deep frying with the PINSOON power air fryer is so easy that anyone can do it! Set the temperature and time with the easy-to-use LED touchscreen, and have a delicious meal for up to 4 people ready in as little as 30 minutes. Built For Safety With its overheat protection and auto-shut off safety systems, the PINSOON oilless deep fryer is the safest air fryer you’ll ever own. It also features a handy detachable basket with “cool touch” handle, making it safe and easy to use without oven mitts or potholders. Specs Color: Black Capacity: 3.7 QT Power: 1350 watts Highest Temperature: 400℉ Rated Voltage: AC120V/60Hz Dimensions: 10.23’’ x 10.23’’ x 12.2’’ Unit Weight: 10.8 lbs Enjoy Fried Foods Without the Fat, Danger, and Mess Fried foods are delicious but traditional deep frying is messy, dangerous, and unhealthy. The PINSOON oilless air fryer solves all these problems, feeding a family of 4 with 80% less fat, while keeping you safe built in safety features. If you love fried foods but want a safer, healthier alternative, this is the oilless deep fryer you’ve been looking for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fB8HJi7KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINSOON","source_asin":"B07XDRRQPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XDRRQPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XDRRQPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
