window.products.push({"id":613069,"name":"Simplify Set of Two 24inch Wreath Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZHpfSXbIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hair Loss and Hair Regrowth Treatment Foam, One Month SupplyAs everyone ages, hair follicles begin to shrink, leading to thinning hair (or loss of hair density). Each hair passes through four stages: anagen, catagen, telogen and exogen. Every hair is at a different stage of the growth cycle.What to expect-- When you first begin to use a BUOCEANS hair loss treatment, your hair loss may continue for up to 2 weeks. This is normal and only temporary, as thinner hairs are shed so thicker hairs can grow in their place.-- It takes time to regrow hair. Results may occur at 2 months with a twice a day usage. For some people, you may need to use this product for at least 4 months before you see results.Users may notice a difference in as little as three or four months:Stage 1- Nourishes hair follicles from within.Stage 2- Strengthens and promotes the growth of existing hair.Stage 3- Promotes the growth of hair that has slowed or stopped growing.Stage 4- Hair is noticeably stronger, healthier and more vibrant.This powerful blend utilizes the benefits of premium organic ingredients to help keep hair looking healthy, and is free of all harmful chemicals in our newly expanded No list. Customer Service:If you have any problems please contact us. We have 24 hours on-line customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZHpfSXbIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simplify","source_asin":"B00MH31OSU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MH31OSU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MH31OSU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
