window.products.push({"id":613210,"name":"Nakiri Knife, LongQuan Knife Series, Vegetable Knife, Hand Foeged High Carbon Steel Cutting Knife with Brass Carving and Ergonomic Handle for Home Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8dWZxQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥦[Ideal Vegetable Knife]: This vegetable kitchen knife is lightweight and has a straight blade to cut all types of vegetables with precision. The nakiri is the perfect knife for creating clean cuts of root vegetables, hard to chop veggies, and even those delicate vegetables that sometimes squish under heavier, thicker blades. 💎[Hundred times forged steel]: The blade of Asian nakiri knife is made of 7Cr17MOV steel with 58+ hardness. The blades are not only sharp but also very wear-resistant. However, compared to stainless steel, the rust resistance is a little weaker, so you need to wipe as soon as possible after use, away from water and gas.Our special hand forged blade looks even better than those damascus cleavers ⚒️ [Ancient forging process]: Longquan nakiri knives have all undergone 5000 times of repeated forging and hammering, 12 times of high temperature furnace fire quenching at 1100 degrees, as well as 180 minutes of manual fine opening of the blade, the hand-forged surface will be harder and sharper, suitable for fast cutting. ✋[Ergonomic Handle]: The handle of nakiri knife is made of pearwood, and the handle has an overall comfortable grip and a recessed stripe on the surface so that it is slip and oil resistant. The rivets at the end of the handle serve to reinforce the handle. 📃[Guarantee]: We provide 100% satisfaction or money back guarantee service, which helps you bear the risk of trial. We guarantee to provide high-quality products with gift boxes, which is the best choice for your Christmas and New Year gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8dWZxQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLADESMITH","source_asin":"B09K5HZGWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K5HZGWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K5HZGWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
