window.products.push({"id":613308,"name":"Belham Living Surveyor Cedar Chest (Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C+5qu5wGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cleaning up and putting things away always feels rewarding, so imagine how rewarding it will feel to store extra items in the Belham Living Surveyor Cedar Chest - Antique Ivory. Made of strong MDF wood, a dense type of engineered wood that resists warping, and covered in lovely wood veneers, this chest has raised detailing on the front and a fully finished back, so you can confidently place it in open spaces. You can also rest assured that this chest won't slam, as it has a convenient flip-top lid with stay-put safety hinges to protect curious little fingers … and big ones, too. Featuring real cedar veneer interior lining - with the signature scent of cedar - this chest is perfect for storing clothes, quilts, and more. The antique ivory finish has a fresh, clean look, so this cedar chest coordinates well with most any room decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C+5qu5wGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belham","source_asin":"B00G1ECCIM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G1ECCIM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G1ECCIM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613309,"name":"Julienne Peeler and Vegetable Peeler - Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sjf60qzqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"It is our first anniversary together and I am making dinner. Picture this - two of us dancing under outdoor lights strung through trees. I admit, it did take me a while this afternoon to set them up. But it will be worth it. Then, I am going to take her by the hands and head down to the beach and watch the waves beat against the rocks. Should I ask the big question tonight ... Half an hour more! I got distracted again. This dual use julienne and vegetable peeler is turning out to be a real lifesaver! And she absolutely loves vegetable noodles and this little baby is making me look really good tonight. Thank you Amazon for prompt delivery after I hit \"add to cart\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sjf60qzqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"miQQi Living","source_asin":"B00KP37N7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KP37N7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KP37N7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
