window.products.push({"id":613438,"name":"HLC.ME White Sheer Voile Tab Top Window Treatment Cafe Tier Curtain Panels for Kitchen, Bedroom, Small Windows and Bathroom (54 x 45 inch Long, Set of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71daOIc-XYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sheer voile curtains give a light, romantic and airy look to a room by allowing sunlight to pass through the curtains. The fabric of voile curtains makes a unique window treatment that allows you to see outside but still allowing for privacy. For most home owners this is a great feature of sheer voile tier curtains. Light weight sheer voile curtains are a very effective decorating tool. Because of the lightness to the fabric allow light to enter the room while still providing privacy. They can be used for in many other ways as well. One of the great qualities to sheer voile curtains is they they come in a wide variety of colors and are generally inexpensive. This allows your to use them in every room of the house without breaking your budget. Sheer curtains are very easy to install and make them a great addition to any room as you can create a designer look with little effort. Each curtain panel can fit a curtain rod up to 1. 5 inch. Fiber Content: 100% Polyester. Package contains two (2) voile sheer window curtain panels. Care Instructions: Machine wash cold, Gentle Cycle. Use only non-chlorine. Bleach as needed. Tumble Dry Low. Iron on lowest setting as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71daOIc-XYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B083VSPZYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083VSPZYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083VSPZYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613439,"name":"Cybrtrayd Lips Valentine Chocolate Candy Mold, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F1r2anksL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F1r2anksL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EAALL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EAALL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EAALL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
