window.products.push({"id":613454,"name":"Milliard Reading Pillow with Shredded Memory Foam for Kids, Sit Up Floor Gaming Chair Bed Pillow with Faux Fur Washable Cover –14x13 inches (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bz0iyOtjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A quiet afternoon with a good book is a great way to spend your time, but finding a cozy spot to snuggle up to your story can be a challenge. With a Milliard Shredded Foam Reading Pillow, story time will literally welcome you with open arms as this light and airy cushion hugs your body and props you up in the perfect position for reading. Gimme A Hug Armrests are built into this wraparound back pillow for a soft, supportive embrace you can take just about anywhere. On the floor, on a sofa, on a bed, in a reading nook, on the patio… anywhere you want to sit, relax, and prop yourself up to a morning tea, an afternoon read, or a pleasant movie night. No Beans About It Why sit on beanbag pillows when they’re stuffed with something that belongs in a burrito? Sure, they’re not actual beans, but plastic pellets are still hard, grainy, and not comfortable against your back. Instead, our pillow is stuffed with shredded, high density, polyurethane memory foam that’s renowned for body contouring softness. Customized Comfort The memory foam stuffing also has its own accessible insert that can be stuffed with more foam for extra firmness, or emptied for those that prefer their pillows mushy. If your pillow catches a coffee spill or just needs a little freshening up, you can also unzip the outer cover and toss it in your washing machine for a quick cleaning. Great For: Reading upright in bed Curling up on the sofa Playing video games on the floor Bolstering posture for bad back Sleeping upright for nasal congestion Elevating injured arms and legs All Milliard products are made from the highest quality materials and we are glad to make our consumers’ satisfaction our #1 goal. Be sure to check out our other great products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bz0iyOtjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milliard","source_asin":"B09J94W3MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J94W3MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J94W3MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
