window.products.push({"id":613819,"name":"Seliem Vintage Bird Branch Table Runner, Winter Cardinal Chickadee Berry Scarf Home Kitchen Red Black Buffalo Plaid Check Decor, Christmas Farmhouse B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BYP2sQT6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Farmhouse Table Runner: Our rustic linen table runner adopts the most popular element design nowadays, which can add fashion and vitality to your house. Use the various themed seasonal table decorations we provide to decorate your coffee table, dining table and kitchen to express your positive attitude towards life. As a condolence and sympathy for the dead, this memory table runner can be used as a memorial gift for those who have lost their loved ones High Quality Table Decor: This stylish table runner is made of 100% spun polyester, durable and eco-friendly. 13\" x 72\" with exquisite edges. The tablecloth uses high-definition printing and bright colors are not easy to fade, and it is easy to match your house decoration. Common styles are suitable for spring, summer, autumn and winter Kitchen Decor: Our farmhouse-style table runner is a must-have for parties and dinners. The beautifully-looking table runner can be used for dining table, shoe cabinet, and coffee table decoration, which can enhance the festive atmosphere at the party and impress your guests Widely Use: The table runner is suitable for decorating sideboards, tables, buffet cabinets, TV tables, farm tables, coffee bars, buffet tables, dressing tables, making your life unique and elegant. This rustic table decoration is not only suitable for daily dining, but also suitable for family gatherings, indoor and outdoor parties on holidays like Christmas Thanksgiving and July 4th, etc Care Instructions: Machine washable, Hand wash recommended. Dry on low heat, remove just before it is completely dry to minimize wrinkles, low iron if needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BYP2sQT6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seliem","source_asin":"B0B8D48LC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8D48LC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8D48LC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613820,"name":"Backbacker, Firm - w/Moisture Resistant Cover and Pillow Case; 20 inches long; Over 1,000 sold on 3 continents. Designed to improve side resting. We s","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81msApixqxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BackBacker comes in soft, medium & firm with an institutional-grade protective cover and fitted pillow case. All models are made of comfortable, supportive, body-contouring, made-in-the-USA, foam. It primarily gives aid to surgery, hospice, longer-term bed-ridden, recovering and other individuals who cannot lie on their backs for extended periods of time and want to rest in varying positions. Its unique design also allows individuals to remain lying on their side longer, making it ideal for those suffering from skin breakdown or extended convalescent time. Many also use it during the recovery period following surgery when lying on the back is difficult. The BackBacker is designed with three different angles that are exclusive to the product and make it one-of-a-kind in the industry. Each of the three angles gives the user a different comfort choice and allows an individual to stay resting on the side for longer periods of time…affording more comfort during the healing process. The BackBacker is 20\" long & the 3 sides vary in length, (approx 6\", 7\" & 9\"). Due to the personal-use nature of the product RETURNS CANNOT BE ACCEPTED. Please ask questions if unsure. Testimonials: \"We love The BackBacker. It is soft, comfortable and works so well for so many different circumstances and patients.\" National Rehabilitation Hospital; \"A recent patient needed back support, I placed it behind her back and all I heard was Ahhhhhh.\" Hospital Nurse; \"I need to rest in specific positions to relieve pain. I was trying to use pillows or whatever else I could find - nothing worked. FINALLY, I came across the BackBacker. It holds me in place, maintains ice packs, and I can adjust it myself. I cannot sleep or rest without it!!\" Bedridden User; \"After a serious accident I needed support, but pillows kept collapsing and slipping. The BackBacker was a life-saver! The different angles were wonderful.\" Accident Victim","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81msApixqxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BackBacker, The BackBacker","source_asin":"B00JZBOQ7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JZBOQ7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JZBOQ7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
