window.products.push({"id":613829,"name":"Hcooker Standard Two-Tray Kitchen Wood Steamer Basket for Asian Cooking Buns Dumplings Vegetables Fish Rice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AKqbUx+oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Steaming is an important and widely used cooking technique in the Asian kitchen. Most kitchens in Asia do not have ovens, therefore baking or roasting are not commonly used cooking techniques. Instead, dumplings, breads, cakes, and other desserts are steamed. There are also wonderful soups and meat dishes and superb fish and seafood specialties that are cooked to perfection in the gentle, moist heat of a steamer. Steaming is also a perfect way to refresh stale bread and reheat leftovers. Steaming has gained popularity in the Western kitchen for its convenience, simplicity, health benefits and energy savings. Steaming envelopes the food in a hot, moist environment so it won’t dry out. And unlike boiling, natural juices, minerals and vitamins as well as color in foods are retained and not drained out in the sink. Steaming is also a very low fat way to cook because you need very little or no oils. Food should not be placed directly in the bamboo steamer without a plate (if the food is marinated, such as fish and meat) or parchment liner (if food is dry, such as buns and dumplings) and allow at least 1- inch space between the sides of the plate and the sides of the steamer.The steamer from Hcooker's Asian Kitchen line is crafted of natural cedar. Compared with bamboo steamer, wooden steamer better insulation performance, and not easy to moldy and cracking.Cleaning and MaintenanceAbout the smell: natural cedar has the original fragrance of the wood, if you mind, you can put the tea in the cage and steam for a few minutes to reduce the smell.Before use: wash with water and then dry it in the vents.After use: the grease must be cleaned. The food residue must be cleaned during cleaning, otherwise it will easily lead to mold. Not often used or not used for a long time, boiled with boiling water for a while and then dried in the vent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AKqbUx+oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hcooker","source_asin":"B082W6XPW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082W6XPW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082W6XPW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613830,"name":"2 Pieces Salt and Pepper Shakers Set, Spice Dispenser with Stainless Steel Lid Pour Holes Glass Refillable Pepper Shaker Seasoning Cans for Home, Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dfux4R+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you get: you will receive 1 piece of salt shaker, and 1 piece of pepper shaker, both measure 4.5 inch high, and hold about 4 ounces of salt and peppers, suitable for home, restaurant, school, and canteen use Durable material: the spice dispenser with adjustable holes is made of strong stainless steel with clear glass bottom that helps you verify when the seasoner getting low, rustproof, easy to clean, designed for a long period of application Easy to use: equipped with adjustable pour holes that are the just the right size on the lid, the refillable shaker ensures salt and pepper end up only on your food, prevent spilling over the table, allows you to easily control the amount of salt and pepper added to your meal Easy to refill: the glass bottom will let you know when it' time to refill, avoiding the hassle of constantly removing the cap; The stainless steel top easily screws off revealing a wide opening for easy and quick refills without having to worry about messing up your table Wide application: this stainless steel glass spice shaker is suitable for home, restaurant, cafe, deli shop, and canteen use, sealing your spices keeping your salt and pepper fresh, can be taken as a practical gift to your friends, family, and colleagues on birthday, housewarming, Christmas, and Mother's Day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dfux4R+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patelai","source_asin":"B0995J9BTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995J9BTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995J9BTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
