window.products.push({"id":613925,"name":"6 Shot Glass Dispenser and Holder, Dispenser for Filling Liquids with 6 Pcs 1.2oz Acrylic Cup for Bar Shot, Wine, Cocktail and Whiskey Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713v1CSmEXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This dispenser for filling liquids is very suitable for family gatherings, invite your friends to enjoy happy time together. It will surprise your friends very much. The best way to evenly pour all 6 shots is to: 1. make sure the surface is level, 2. Pour quickly to the height of the middle hump. How it works: You simply place one shot glass under each spout; There are six spouts, Each outlet has a stopper, you can control the number of cups poured at the same time. Then it dispenses that liquid gold to all the shot glasses below and boom, you have shots for six almost instantly. It even includes a carrier, so you can simply lift it up and bring them over to your friends. Specification: Material: High-quality PMMA material Product weight: 150G Product size 14×14×13cm Package Contents: 1 x Shot dispenser 6 x Shot Glass","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713v1CSmEXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEW L.S.Y CORP.","source_asin":"B08YDJL4L2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDJL4L2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDJL4L2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613926,"name":"HOMBYS Oversized King Quilt Set 120x128, Lightweight White Ultrasonic Quilted Bedspread with 2 Pillow Shams,Reversible Geometric Quilt 3 Pieces, Soft ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vIqf8gD+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUPER BIG!!!】Easily cover all sides and end of your bed, even with extra layers of padding! This Lightweight bedspread wraps you in luxurious warmth for your most restful night sleep. 【GEOMETRIC QUILTED PATTERN】 With the solid color both front and reverse elevates how sensational a single color can be - Subtle weaved bedspread quilt sewed with neat stitches that gives it classic and romantic charm to enhance your bed - A classic stitch pattern in pop hues makes the bedspread a cozy and colorful choice for your bed. 【VERSATILE & LIGHTWEIGHT】Designed with simple design philosophy to remain its vibrancy for ultimate lightweight and fabulous sleeping comfort - All season use, perfect for summer quilt or as a winter topper with blankets underneath - Can be used as the quilt, bedspread, and coverlet - An easy thing to pack along, perfect for travel, home decor and gifts. 【PREMIUM MICROFIBER QUALITY】Utilizes 100% microfiber fabric all three layers to last for years and resist fade, stain and pill better than others like cotton - Microfiber coverlet quilt is NOT tend to bunch with time like cotton which has little elasticity - Bedspreads coverlets will keep your body fresh and ensure a comfortable sleep all night long. 100% polyester filling. 【Easy Care】Machine wash cold, gentle cycle, only non-chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry low, steam if needed, do not iron. No shrinkage and no unraveling after washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vIqf8gD+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMBYS","source_asin":"B0BMWRQ586","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMWRQ586","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMWRQ586","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613927,"name":"GJMY Feng Shui Coins with Brass Calabash Wu Lou Key Chain for Longevity Travel Safely Wealth Porsperity Success and Good Luck with Blessing Paper in i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613YdhcpRsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Wu Lou (Calabash) in its original form is a fruit and when dried was traditionally used to store medicine or water which is is how it got its name “giver of life”. The shape of the Calabash was replicated into brass (metal weakens earth) by Feng Shui masters many years ago in order to absorb the negative energy of the bad luck stars.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613YdhcpRsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GJMY","source_asin":"B089GY53BZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GY53BZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GY53BZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
