window.products.push({"id":613982,"name":"Lunch Bag for Women & Men, Adult Insulated Lunch Box Large 15L Picnic time Lunch Bag with Adjustable Shoulder Strap,Leakproof 16 can Cooler Bag with S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81INGNOux8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lunch bag for Women and Men Large Capacity: 11.2”L*9.8”W*3.3”H. The maximum capacity is 15L, spacy enough to store 16 tins of coke (330ml),1 front pocket,2 mesh pockets, not only provides you with plenty of space to pack all of your food and drinks you need whole day, as well as pack your keys, cards, phone chargers, napkins, water bottles, utensils, gum or other small stuffs you daily needs. Long-Term Insulation: The lunch bag is made of insulated material which can keep foods and drinks cool or warm for more than 5 hours. Besides, the interior lining is made of food grade PEVA foil so you could put your foods into the bag directly. The built-in 6mm EPE foam provides great protection to your containers, foods and drinks. Leakproof: Extra thick soft PEVA liner and the heat-welded seams to guard against leaks and easy to clean. If Ice cubes or sauce cause moisture, just wipe it off with wet cloth or napkins. Premium composite waterproof fabric is resistant to dirty and abrasion, protecting your lunch and items inside from occasional splatters or light rain. Simple Modern Lunch box Convenient & Portable: Reusable lunch box features one reinforced handle on top and comes with an adjustable shoulder which can be adjusted from 15\"\" to 27\"\" when carrying offer you more carrying options. Padded soft strap ensures comfortable carry. Wide opening design makes it convenient to fill and take food. Modern and lightweight design is convenient to be used as your lunch bag, cooler bag, picnic bag, sundry bag or shopping bag. VERSATILE - This adult lunch bag also can be used as picnic time lunch bag,insulated cooler bag for picnic, beach, camping and travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81INGNOux8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CALIYO","source_asin":"B09YNBVLD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YNBVLD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YNBVLD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
