window.products.push({"id":613984,"name":"Waterford Times Square Masterpiece Ball - 6\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oQVUOnl4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Each year at December 31st. at New York's Times Square, the ball drop signals the beginning of the New Year! The Times Square ball is made of Waterford Crystal panels. Each panel features a wish for humanity. Each year the new sentiment is added with new panels added to the famous ball. The sentiment for 2016 is the \"The Gift of Wonder\", which represents mankind's fascination with the unknown and unexplored.The Waterford Crystal Times Square New Year's Eve Ball Greatest Gifts Collection is a distinctive 10 Year issue of ornaments, toasting flutes and collectibles. Beginning with the Gift of Imagination, in 2014 and concluding in 2023 with the Gift of Love, each annual edition of the Greatest Gifts series will depict a gift a theme of global aspiration whose value is universally treasured.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oQVUOnl4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B00UX3YDIE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UX3YDIE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UX3YDIE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":613985,"name":"Cestari Advanced Ceramic Revolution Bread Knife - 8 Inch Serrated Blade Never Needs Sharpening - Premium Kitchen Knife with Safety Sheath and Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aWHQmqtAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FORGET ABOUT SHARPENING WITH THIS CERAMIC KNIFE. The advanced 8\" ceramic blade of this bread and vegetable knife holds its exceptionally sharp edge more than ten times longer than stainless or carbon steel cutlery. Unlike stainless steel, ceramic knives don't ever react with foods, and never rust. The razor sharp edge means that you can use it as a bread scoring knife in place of a lame when you are baking bread. CUT PAPER THIN SLICES IN SECONDS. This bread slicer cuts through melons, tomatoes, crusty bread, meat , and cheese. Its serrated blade makes it the perfect tomato slicer as it cuts through the thin, slippery skins of tomatoes and other fruits and vegetables without crushing the interior. It will not only be your go to bread knife, but your most frequently used cheese knife, pizza knife, sandwich knife, and fruit knife as well. COMFORTABLE RUBBERIZED HANDLE won't slip. Chefs rave about its perfectly balanced, nonskid ergonomic grip, solid contoured handle designed for controlled use. The knife's remarkably lightweight, ergonomic design reduces fatigue during repetitive cutting chores. The large ceramic knife blade means you will be able to use this for many everyday kitchen tasks. EASY CARE Single piece satin finish polypropylene handle has no seams to harbor germs or bacteria; top rack dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. The knife sheath is custom molded to keep the blade safe in a drawer. The cover also keeps your fingers safe when reaching for the knife. LIFETIME REPLACEMENT WARRANTY: Return for replacement at any time, for any reason, no questions asked","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aWHQmqtAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cestari","source_asin":"B07YP63TSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-613985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YP63TSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YP63TSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
